{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269F6RJHVGBl1792752010.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西藏那曲市巴青縣發生7級地震，有本港旅行團於地震發生時正在拉薩，全部人安全。旅行社稱，旅客一般都較少到那曲市遊覽。</p><p></p><p>縱橫遊常務董事袁振寧說：「多不多香港旅客會去那曲地區，其實就不多的，因為海拔比較高、達4千多米。無太多主要景點，主要是草原，除非很深度遊的旅客，才會乘車去看牛、藏羚羊等。」</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE.REAX 1830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cXZ8guhQOR1792752090.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>本港入境處稱，地震後已即時透過駐成都經貿辦，以及旅監局了解情況，暫時無接獲港人求助，會繼續保持緊密聯繫，留意事態發展。行政長官李家超在社文平台發帖文，向遇難同胞表示深切哀悼，又稱特區政府會留意災情發展，隨時準備透過賑災基金，提供適切援助。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:43.675433+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":264,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T09:58:17.269397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:14.570215+00:00","content_hash":"ed6ac2a3fc3947dba45a8c8acd63fdea8022b03c81ffe78fc18c71eb9759e38c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:43.675433+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}